name: roaming_imsi_footprint
description: "DEMO 1c — Subscriber footprint: each roaming IMSI linked to the visited networks that billed it (synthetic 001-prefixed IMSIs). A normal roamer touches one or two partners; IMSI 001010000000042 touches four in three days — Explain node / Centrality surface it (links fold per IMSI, network and event type)."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force-cluster
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: roaming_tap_dataset
    sourceCol: IMSI
    targetCol: SENDER_NAME
    linkKindCol: EVENT_TYPE
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
